    "detailed_description": "<strong>Koibumi</strong>.<br>It is a letter confessing love. A so-called love letter.<br>All you need to convey your feelings is love, courage and a little luck.<br>You become the love letter and deliver your feelings to that girl.<br>Whether this love will succeed or not is up to you.<br><br><strong>Objective of the game:</strong><br>You control a paper airplane and fly through the sky to deliver your love to her.<br>However, the paper airplane is fragile and if it hits something, it will crash and the game over.<br>If you just want to deliver it, it will be easy.<br>It may be difficult to collect hearts and fill them with feelings.",
